A continuous 13.5-second commercial video with smooth transitions. The video starts in a modern student dorm with grey metal bunk beds and a wooden desk. Schoolgirl A (young female, black shoulder-length straight hair, air bangs, wearing a Japanese blue-and-white sailor water suit) is panicking and grabs the arm of Schoolgirl B (young female, brown long curly hair, air bangs, wearing a beige round-neck sweater). Schoolgirl A whispers anxiously in B's ear. B smiles relaxedly and gestures. A's face freezes in complete shock with wide eyes. The scene smoothly transitions to a warm indoor setting with wooden bookshelves and soft golden light. An elegant middle-aged mother (retro wave updo, dark green velvet qipao, black fur shawl) gracefully enters, holding a blue-and-white 'Cao Ben Yi' herbal sanitary pad box decorated with green mugwort and blue water splash patterns. She presents the box to the camera. The camera zooms in on the box showing cool mist and fresh water droplets, then transitions to a macro shot of the soft breathable cotton texture of the pad with floating green leaves. Finally, the camera pulls back to a medium shot of the mother smiling warmly under a cozy golden backlight, exuding care and love. Natural skin tone, clear dark brown eyes, no abnormal facial redness, no bloodshot eyes, smooth motion, cinematic lighting.",
  "supplementary": {
    "duration": "13.5 seconds",
    "dialogue": [
      {"speaker": "女学生A", "time": "0.0s - 1.5s", "tone": "急切、小声", "text": "天呐，我那个突然来了！你带那个了吗？"},
      {"speaker": "女学生B", "time": "3.0s - 4.5s", "tone": "轻松、微笑", "text": "我早就不穿普通姨妈巾啦，我一直用我妈给我买的‘冰沙巾’！"},
      {"speaker": "女学生A", "time": "4.5s - 6.0s", "tone": "诧异、上扬", "text": "冰沙巾？！"}
    ],
    "voiceover": [
      {"identity": "女学生A", "time_range": "1.5s - 3.0s", "tone": "悄声、急促", "text": "救急！借我一片姨妈巾！"},
      {"identity": "中年母亲", "time_range": "6.0s - 7.5s", "tone": "温柔、知性", "text": "女孩子，要对自己好一点。"},
      {"identity": "中年母亲旁白", "time_range": "9.0s - 10.5s", "tone": "温柔、推荐", "text": "草本伊艾草植萃冰沙巾，舒服又透气。"},
      {"identity": "中年母亲", "time_range": "12.0s - 13.5s", "tone": "温柔、充满爱意", "text": "给女儿的，当然要选最好的。"}
    ],
    "sound_effect": [
      {"time": "0.0s", "description": "衣服摩擦声与椅子轻微挪动声"},
      {"time": "4.5s", "description": "清脆的定格音效（叮——），突出疑问悬念"},
      {"time": "7.5s", "description": "冰爽的水滴声与微风拂过声"},
      {"time": "10.5s", "description": "轻柔的微风吹过声伴随冰块微碎的清脆声"},
      {"time": "12.0s", "description": "温馨治愈的钢琴单音落下，余音环绕"}
    ],
    "copy": "草本伊艾草植萃冰沙巾：冰爽透气，给女孩最温柔的呵护。",
    "soundtrack_suggestion": "开头使用轻快、略带日常感的小提琴拨弦，4.5秒转折后切入轻柔、温馨治愈的钢琴与微风白噪音铺底，结尾以温暖的钢琴和弦收尾。"
